  "description": "Constraint-kernel contracts and built-in field types for Dignite.Abp.FlexFields: IFlexFieldData/FlexFieldData (the DDD-free field definition carrier, mirroring ABP's IUserData/UserData), the FlexFieldValue runtime carrier, IHasFlexFields/FlexFieldDictionary (the value bag), FieldConfigurationDictionary, the FlexFieldQueryCondition query vocabulary, and IFieldType/FieldTypeBase plus the Text/Number/DateTime/Select/Boolean/Tree/Matrix/Table field types and their configuration - Matrix and Table being composite types, whose configuration declares further fields inline (ICompositeFieldType/InlineFieldDefinition), normalize their own value shape on write (INormalizesValue) and are capped at CompositeFieldNesting.MaxDepth levels of nesting. Self-contained: referencing this package alone is enough to implement a custom field type or to type a downstream's DTOs. Contains no Entity contract and no persistence shape - those start at Dignite.Abp.FlexFields.Domain and Dignite.Abp.FlexFields.EntityFrameworkCore respectively.",
